units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
newton on
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
comm_modify vel yes

lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
reset_timestep 0

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni

thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol
thermo 1000

velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes dist gaussian

fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
run 220000
unfix 1